.SH "PostCSS"
.PP

.PP
PostCSS is a tool for transforming styles with JS plugins\&. These plugins can lint your CSS, support variables and mixins, transpile future CSS syntax, inline images, and more\&.

.PP
PostCSS is used by industry leaders including Wikipedia, Twitter, Alibaba, and JetBrains\&. The \fRAutoprefixer\fP and \fRStylelint\fP PostCSS plugins are some of the most popular CSS tools\&.

